    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμβρός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>connexion by marriage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				708
			</span></i> (pl.): hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>son-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.249
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.30
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				272
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				427
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>brother-in-law</i>, i.e. <i>sister's husband</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.474
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.464
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.73
			</span></i>, etc.; or, <i>wife's brother</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενθερός</span>
			, <i>father-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				635
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Andr.</u>
				641
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				Dor.
			 and 
				Aeol.
			, <i>bridegroom, wooer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				18.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				248
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>jārá-</i> (from
				<i>ĝ[mmacrnull]ró-</i>
		'lover'.)</div>
